                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "66ee8aa9-3b16-4e3b-aece-eb6c95993093",
                                "sense_id": "4a255798-e500-30f9-a5d1-a7a2e7e3b8d6",
                                "text": "He has also provided some of the show's funniest moments - when enjoying a bath with Three Degrees star Sheila Ferguson he told her: 'I'm comfortable with anything, love, but you don't want to see my 'Jacobs' hanging out.'"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "443cc071-2ee7-4bd2-8103-a39087d2f2a7",
                                "sense_id": "4a255798-e500-30f9-a5d1-a7a2e7e3b8d6",
                                "text": "I used to have a Velo seat, which is pretty similar to the KH in design, and I got rid of it for the same reason. The padding was so deep and spongey that my Jacobs used to float to the top as I rode along."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d275e60d-9023-4f1e-b61c-745c63a2172c",
                                "sense_id": "4a255798-e500-30f9-a5d1-a7a2e7e3b8d6",
                                "text": "Horseshit every match matters and Alex Ferguson would drag his players out of the club by their Jacobs if they made such a statement."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "7da353c4-eafa-35ac-b484-22b9f0081a84",
                "word": "jacobs",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b85013d3-1baf-30cd-9817-b9d080fde0ac",
                        "entry_id": "7da353c4-eafa-35ac-b484-22b9f0081a84",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative form of Jacobs."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "alt-of",
                            "alternative",
                            "plural",
                            "plural-only"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "236ca575-621c-4ca1-8aae-f288b1a196a2",
                                "sense_id": "b85013d3-1baf-30cd-9817-b9d080fde0ac",
                                "text": "He'd hit you with his wallet? What an opportunity!!! You could have kicked him in his jacobs, jumped on his head & ran off with his money."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a9fa05ce-ca1d-40c9-9837-5cfcc87c1c5d",
                                "sense_id": "b85013d3-1baf-30cd-9817-b9d080fde0ac",
                                "text": "\"last time I was at Muirkirk (In april I think) I was moaning about the cold while dressed in a few arctic fleeces, bunnet etc and a local came up to me in a thin jacket and said \"braw warm today eh mate\" I was freezing my jacobs off\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "61be03a6-4cb3-413d-bb26-2c09356abf29",
                                "sense_id": "b85013d3-1baf-30cd-9817-b9d080fde0ac",
                                "text": "It was almost 6:30 and the sun was breaking the horizon, better get the boss back to the safety of her fortress-like house on Beverly St., or it might be his jacobs in a jar!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
